{% doc %}
  @prompt
    I want you to redesign my existing Shopify PRODUCT PAGE for SBL Nursery.
    
    I am providing a reference screenshot of a premium online plant product page.
    
    Use the screenshot ONLY as a UX/layout reference. Do not copy the branding, logo, text, images, colors, or exact design.
    
    First inspect my existing Shopify product template and then implement the changes directly in the correct Shopify files.
    
    ==================================================
    OVERALL PRODUCT PAGE STRUCTURE
    ==================================================
    
    Create a clean two-column product page on desktop:
    
    LEFT:
    Product image gallery
    
    RIGHT:
    Product information + variants + price + cart + offers + delivery + plant information
    
    On mobile:
    Stack everything vertically.
    
    The product page must remain fully responsive.
    
    ==================================================
    1. PRODUCT IMAGE GALLERY
    ==================================================
    
    Create a premium image gallery similar to the reference layout.
    
    Desktop:
    
    LEFT SIDE:
    Vertical thumbnail gallery
    
    CENTER:
    Large main product image
    
    Requirements:
    
    - Use Shopify product images dynamically.
    - Show all available product images.
    - Vertical thumbnails on desktop.
    - Horizontal/swipe thumbnails on mobile.
    - Clicking a thumbnail changes the main image.
    - Main image should support zoom.
    - Add smooth image transitions.
    - Do not unnecessarily crop plant images.
    - Maintain good image proportions.
    - Support product videos if available.
    
    Add an optional image badge such as:
    
    NEW
    BESTSELLER
    SALE
    
    The badge should be controlled through Shopify product data/metafields.
    
    ==================================================
    2. PRODUCT INFORMATION
    ==================================================
    
    Right side should contain:
    
    Rating
    Product title
    Short description
    
    Example:
    
    ★★★★★ 4.8 | 120 Reviews
    
    Money Plant Golden
    
    Easy-care indoor plant that adds natural greenery to your home.
    
    The product title must come dynamically from Shopify.
    
    Rating should come from the existing review app if installed.
    
    Do NOT hardcode fake ratings.
    
    ==================================================
    3. PLANT SIZE SELECTION
    ==================================================
    
    Create a clearly visible:
    
    SELECT PLANT SIZE
    
    section.
    
    Example:
    
    Small
    Medium
    Large
    
    Use Shopify product variants.
    
    When the customer selects a size:
    
    - Update price.
    - Update availability.
    - Update product image if the variant has an image.
    - Update selected state.
    
    Do not create a separate fake selection system.
    
    ==================================================
    4. POT / PLANTER SELECTION
    ==================================================
    
    If the product has pot/planter options, create:
    
    SELECT YOUR POT
    
    Display each available option as a visual selection card.
    
    Each card can contain:
    
    Pot image
    Pot name
    Additional price
    
    Example:
    
    Grow Pot
    ₹599
    
    Black Pot
    ₹699
    
    Decorative Pot
    ₹999
    
    The selected option should have a clear active state.
    
    Use Shopify variants or product options wherever possible.
    
    Do not hardcode these options.
    
    If the product does not have pot variants, automatically hide this section.
    
    ==================================================
    5. COLOR SELECTION
    ==================================================
    
    If the product has a color variant:
    
    COLOR – Ivory
    
    Show color swatches.
    
    Use Shopify variant data.
    
    When a color is selected:
    
    - Update variant.
    - Update image.
    - Update price.
    - Update availability.
    
    Hide the color selector when the product doesn't have a color option.
    
    ==================================================
    6. PRICE
    ==================================================
    
    Display:
    
    Current Price
    Compare-at Price
    Discount %
    
    Example:
    
    ₹699  ₹899
    
    20% OFF
    
    If there is no compare-at price, don't show the discount.
    
    Price should update dynamically when variants change.
    
    ==================================================
    7. QUANTITY + ADD TO CART
    ==================================================
    
    Create:
    
    [-] 1 [+]
    
    [ ADD TO CART ]
    
    Add to Cart should be the main CTA.
    
    Use the existing Shopify cart functionality.
    
    Do not replace Shopify cart logic with custom fake functionality.
    
    After clicking Add to Cart:
    
    - Follow the existing theme cart behavior.
    - Support AJAX cart if the theme already uses it.
    - Show confirmation/cart drawer if available.
    
    ==================================================
    8. BUY NOW
    ==================================================
    
    Add an optional:
    
    BUY IT NOW
    
    button using Shopify's dynamic checkout functionality.
    
    Make this controllable through Theme Customizer.
    
    ==================================================
    9. OFFERS SECTION
    ==================================================
    
    Create an attractive but minimal Offers section.
    
    Example:
    
    OFFERS FOR YOU
    
    10% OFF on orders above ₹1,499
    Code: SBL10
    
    FREE SHIPPING on orders above ₹499
    
    The offers must be editable from Theme Customizer.
    
    Allow the admin to:
    
    - Add offer text.
    - Add coupon code.
    - Enable/disable offer rows.
    - Change icon.
    
    Do not hardcode 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | remove: '_' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:auto;color:#14231a}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(300px,.9fr);gap:40px}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:68px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumbs{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-height:680px;overflow:auto}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb{width:64px;height:72px;padding:3px;border:1px solid #cbd5ca;border-radius:9px;background:white;cursor:pointer}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb[aria-current=true]{border:2px solid #1f5130}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stage{position:relative;background:#f8f4ec;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide{display:none;aspect-ratio:1/1;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide.active{display:flex}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide img,.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide video{width:100%;height:100%;max-height:760px;object-fit:contain}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide img{cursor:zoom-in}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;background:#1f5130;color:white;border-radius:30px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;z-index:2}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info{min-width:0}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,38px);line-height:1.15;color:#0d3a1d;margin:0 0 12px}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{color:#1f5130}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{line-height:1.6;color:#5b6660}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-line{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:18px 0}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#0d3a1d}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{text-decoration:line-through;color:#5b6660}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount{background:#edf4e8;color:#1f5130;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:20px}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__option{margin:18px 0}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__option label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;margin-bottom:8px}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__select{width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid #cbd5ca;border-radius:9px;background:white;color:#14231a;font:inherit}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__qty{display:flex;align-items:center;margin:16px 0;border:1px solid #cbd5ca;border-radius:9px;width:max-content;overflow:hidden}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__qty button{height:42px;width:42px;border:0;background:#f8f4ec;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__qty input{width:48px;height:42px;border:0;text-align:center}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add{width:100%;min-height:52px;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add:disabled{opacity:.55}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__offers{margin-top:22px;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;background:#f4f7dc}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__offers h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:#0d3a1d}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__offer{border-top:1px solid #dce5c8;padding:10px 0;font-size:14px}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__code{display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;margin-top:5px;background:#fff;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{position:relative;display:flex;aspect-ratio:1/1;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#f8f4ec}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty svg{width:75%;height:75%}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty span{position:absolute;bottom:12px;color:#5b6660}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dialog{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;background:rgba(10,20,12,.92);border:0;max-width:100vw;max-height:100vh;width:100vw;height:100vh;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dialog[open]{display:flex}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dialog img{max-width:94vw;max-height:90vh;object-fit:contain}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__close{position:absolute;right:20px;top:12px;font-size:32px;color:white;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumbs{order:2;flex-direction:row;max-height:none;overflow-x:auto}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stage{order:1}.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb{flex:0 0 62px}}
{% endstyle %}
<product-detail-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-product='{{ product | json | escape }}' {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
{% if product != blank %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid"><div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__gallery">{% if product.media.size > 1 %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumbs">{% for media in product.media %}<button type="button" class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__thumb" data-thumb="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Show image {{ forloop.index }}" aria-current="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">{% if media.preview_image %}<img src="{{ media.preview_image | image_url: width: 150 }}" alt="{{ media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="75" height="80">{% endif %}</button>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stage">{% assign badge_text = product.metafields.custom.image_badge.value | default: product.metafields.custom.badge.value %}{% if badge_text != blank %}<span class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__badge">{{ badge_text | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% for media in product.media %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__slide{% if forloop.first %} active{% endif %}" data-slide="{{ forloop.index0 }}">{% case media.media_type %}{% when 'image' %}<img src="{{ media | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" width="{{ media.width }}" height="{{ media.height }}" loading="lazy" data-zoom>{% when 'video' %}{{ media | video_tag: controls: true, preload: 'metadata' }}{% when 'external_video' %}{{ media | external_video_tag }}{% when 'model' %}{{ media | model_viewer_tag }}{% endcase %}</div>{% else %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<span>Add product images to show the gallery</span></div>{% endfor %}</div></div><div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__info">{% assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value %}{% assign count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value %}{% if rating != blank %}<p class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ rating }}{% if count != blank %} · {{ count }} reviews{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}<h1 class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>{% if block.settings.show_description and product.description != blank %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 220 | escape }}</div>{% endif %}
{% form 'product', product %}<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" data-variant-id>{% unless product.has_only_default_variant %}{% for option in product.options_with_values %}{% assign opt_name = option.name | downcase %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__option"><label for="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}">{% if opt_name contains 'size' %}SELECT PLANT SIZE{% elsif opt_name contains 'pot' or opt_name contains 'planter' %}SELECT YOUR POT{% elsif opt_name contains 'color' or opt_name contains 'colour' %}COLOR – <span data-opt-label="{{ forloop.index0 }}">{{ option.selected_value | escape }}</span>{% else %}{{ option.name | escape }}{% endif %}</label><select class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__select" id="sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}" data-option="{{ forloop.index0 }}">{% for value in option.values %}<option value="{{ value | escape }}"{% if option.selected_value == value %} selected{% endif %}>{{ value | escape }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></div>{% endfor %}{% endunless %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price-line"><span class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price" data-price>{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money }}</span><s class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare" data-compare{% unless product.selected_or_first_available_variant.compare_at_price > product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price %} hidden{% endunless %}>{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</s><span class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount" data-discount hidden></span></div><div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__qty"><button type="button" data-minus aria-label="Decrease quantity">−</button><input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" value="1" aria-label="Quantity" data-quantity><button type="button" data-plus aria-label="Increase quantity">+</button></div><button type="submit" name="add" class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__add" data-add{% unless product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>{% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}{{ block.settings.add_label | escape }}{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}</button>{% if block.settings.show_buy_now %}{{ form | payment_button }}{% endif %}{% endform %}
{% if block.settings.show_offers %}<aside class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__offers"><h3>{{ block.settings.offers_heading | escape }}</h3>{% for n in (1..3) %}{% assign enabled_key = 'offer_' | append: n | append: '_enabled' %}{% assign icon_key = 'offer_' | append: n | append: '_icon' %}{% assign text_key = 'offer_' | append: n | append: '_text' %}{% assign code_key = 'offer_' | append: n | append: '_code' %}{% if block.settings[enabled_key] %}<div class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__offer"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ block.settings[icon_key] | escape }}</span> {{ block.settings[text_key] | escape }}{% if block.settings[code_key] != blank %}<br><span class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__code">{{ block.settings[code_key] | escape }}</span>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</aside>{% endif %}</div></div><dialog class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dialog" aria-label="Zoomed product image"><button type="button" class="ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__close" aria-label="Close zoom">×</button><img alt=""></dialog>{% endif %}</product-detail-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='product-detail-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class SblDetail extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.p=JSON.parse(this.dataset.product||'{}');this.slides=this.querySelectorAll('[data-slide]');this.thumbs=this.querySelectorAll('[data-thumb]');this.selects=this.querySelectorAll('[data-option]');this.thumbs.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>this.show(b.dataset.thumb)));this.selects.forEach(s=>s.addEventListener('change',()=>this.update()));const q=this.querySelector('[data-quantity]');this.querySelector('[data-minus]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>q.value=Math.max(1,(+q.value||1)-1));this.querySelector('[data-plus]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>q.value=(+q.value||1)+1);this.dialog=this.querySelector('dialog');this.querySelectorAll('[data-zoom]').forEach(i=>i.addEventListener('click',()=>{this.dialog.querySelector('img').src=i.src;this.dialog.querySelector('img').alt=i.alt;this.dialog.showModal()}));this.querySelector('.ai-sbl-{{ ai_gen_id }}__close')?.addEventListener('click',()=>this.dialog.close());this.update()}show(i){this.slides.forEach(s=>s.classList.toggle('active',s.dataset.slide===String(i)));this.thumbs.forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-current',b.dataset.thumb===String(i)?'true':'false'))}update(){if(!this.selects.length)return;const opts=Array.from(this.selects).map(s=>s.value),v=this.p.variants.find(x=>x.options.every((o,i)=>o===opts[i]));if(!v)return;this.querySelector('[data-variant-id]').value=v.id;this.querySelector('[data-price]').textContent=this.money(v.price);const c=this.querySelector('[data-compare]'),d=this.querySelector('[data-discount]');if(v.compare_at_price>v.price){c.hidden=false;c.textContent=this.money(v.compare_at_price);d.hidden=false;d.textContent=Math.round((v.compare_at_price-v.price)*100/v.compare_at_price)+'% off'}else{c.hidden=true;d.hidden=true}const a=this.querySelector('[data-add]');a.disabled=!v.available;a.textContent=v.available?{{ block.settings.add_label | json }}:'Sold out';this.selects.forEach((s,i)=>{const l=this.querySelector('[data-opt-label="'+i+'"]');if(l)l.textContent=opts[i]});if(v.featured_media){const ix=this.p.media?.findIndex(m=>m.id===v.featured_media.id);if(ix>=0)this.show(ix)}}money(cents){return new Intl.NumberFormat(document.documentElement.lang||'en-IN',{style:'currency',currency:this.p.currency||'INR'}).format(cents/100)}}customElements.define(tag,SblDetail)})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"SBL product detail","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_description","label":"Show short description","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"add_label","label":"Add to cart label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_buy_now","label":"Show buy it now","default":false},{"type":"header","content":"Offers"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_offers","label":"Show offers","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"offers_heading","label":"Heading","default":"Offers for you"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"offer_1_enabled","label":"Show offer one","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"offer_1_icon","label":"Offer one icon","default":"✿"},{"type":"text","id":"offer_1_text","label":"Offer one text","default":"Enjoy a special saving on your order"},{"type":"text","id":"offer_1_code","label":"Offer one coupon code"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"offer_2_enabled","label":"Show offer two","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"offer_2_icon","label":"Offer two icon","default":"♧"},{"type":"text","id":"offer_2_text","label":"Offer two text","default":"Complimentary delivery on qualifying orders"},{"type":"text","id":"offer_2_code","label":"Offer two coupon code"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"offer_3_enabled","label":"Show offer three","default":false},{"type":"text","id":"offer_3_icon","label":"Offer three icon","default":"✓"},{"type":"text","id":"offer_3_text","label":"Offer three text","default":"Add a custom offer message"},{"type":"text","id":"offer_3_code","label":"Offer three coupon code"}],"presets":[{"name":"SBL product detail"}],"tag":null,"class":"sbl-product-detail"}{% endschema %}